  "Crash Reporting": "自动发送崩溃报告",
  "Skip Dusklight Main Menu": "跳过主菜单",
  "When starting Dusklight, skip the main menu and boot straight into the ": "启动 Dusklight 时，如果光盘镜像已正确设置，",
  "game if a disc image is available.": "则跳过主菜单，直接启动游戏。",
  "Show Pipeline Compilation": "显示管线编译通知",
  "Show an overlay when shaders are being compiled for your hardware.": "在为您的硬件编译着色器以防止卡顿 (Stuttering) 时，显示叠加的进度通知。",
  "Check for Updates": "自动检查更新",
  "Checks GitHub releases for a new Dusklight version on startup.<br/><br/>": "启动时自动检查 GitHub 发布页面以获取 Dusklight 的新版本。<br/><br/>",
  "No personal information is transmitted or collected.": "不会传输或收集任何个人信息。",
  "Enable Discord Rich Presence": "启用 Discord 状态展示",
  "Enable Dusklight to integrate with Discord Rich Presence. This allows Discord to show your status in-game.": "允许 Dusklight 与 Discord Rich Presence 集成。这将在您的 Discord 状态中展示游戏内动态。",
  "Enable Advanced Settings": "启用高级设置和调试工具",
  "Show advanced settings and debugging tools with ": "按 Shift+F1 键可显示高级设置和调试工具。",
  "Shift+F1.<br/><br/><icon class=\"warning\"/> WARNING: Debugging tools ": "<br/><br/><icon class=\"warning\"/> 警告：滥用调试工具可能",
  "can easily break your game. Do not use on a regular save!": "会严重破坏您的游戏。请勿在常规的珍贵存档中使用！",
  "Show Input Viewer": "显示输入查看器",
  "Display a controller input overlay while playing.": "在游戏时于屏幕边缘显示控制器输入状态的悬浮窗。",
  "Show Gyro Input Viewer": "显示陀螺仪输入查看器",
  "Show gyro sensor values in the input viewer.": "在输入查看器中额外显示控制器的陀螺仪倾斜数值。",
  "Game": "游戏 UI 设置",
  "Menu Scaling Mode": "菜单缩放模式",
  "GameCube": "GameCube",
  "Wii": "Wii",
  "<br/>Changes how the Collection and File Select menus scale to your ": "<br/>更改收集品 (装备) 界面和文件选择菜单在适配",
  "aspect ratio.": "当前显示器宽高比时的缩放方式。",
  "Skip TV Settings Screen": "跳过电视校准画面",
  "Skips the TV calibration screen shown when loading a save.": "跳过每次加载存档时都会出现的电视亮度调整 (校准) 画面。",
  "Recording Mode": "录制模式 (Recording Mode)",
  "Disables the game HUD and all background music.<br/><br/>Useful for recording footage.": "关闭屏幕上的游戏 HUD（生命值、小地图等）以及所有背景音乐 (BGM)。<br/><br/>这在录制干净的游戏视频素材时非常有用。",
  "On": "开启",
  "Off": "关闭",
  "Welcome to Dusklight": "欢迎使用 Dusklight",
  "Choose a preset to get started. You can change any setting later from the Settings menu.": "请选择一个预设以开始游戏。您之后可以随时在设置菜单中更改任何选项。",
  "Classic": "经典 (Classic)",
  "Enhancements disabled to match the GameCube version. Good for speedrunning or simple nostalgia!": "禁用所有增强功能，原汁原味呈现 GameCube 版本体验。非常适合速通玩家或纯粹怀旧的玩家！",
  "Graphics & quality of life tweaks, including some from the Wii U version. Our recommended way to play!": "包含 Wii U 版本的某些特性，应用了画质提升与体验优化。这是我们最推荐的游玩方式！",
  "Send Crash Reports": "发送崩溃报告 (Crash Reports)",
  "Dusklight can automatically send crash reports to the developers. Crash reports contain the following:<br/>• Operating system version<br/>• CPU architecture<br/>• GPU model & driver version<br/>• File paths (may include account username)<br/>• Stack trace<br/><br/>This can be changed in the Settings menu at any time.": "Dusklight 可以自动向开发团队发送崩溃报告。报告包含以下信息：<br/>• 操作系统版本<br/>• CPU 架构<br/>• GPU 型号及驱动版本<br/>• 文件路径（可能包含系统账户名）<br/>• 堆栈跟踪<br/><br/>您之后可随时在设置菜单中更改此选项。",
  "Enable": "启用",
  "Send crash reports to Sentry.": "通过 Sentry 系统发送崩溃报告。",
  "Disable": "禁用",
  "Do not send crash reports.": "不发送崩溃报告。",
  "Apply Options": "应用选项",
